# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/2.0.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [3.0.0] - 2026-10-30

### Added

- Comprehensive PHPUnit 13 test suite covering translators, formatters, entity factories, query executor, unit of work runner/transaction, migrators, and full FirestoreDAO CRUD/criteria lifecycle (49 tests, 197 assertions).
- Added `phpunit.xml` configuration and `test` composer script.

### Changed

- Updated `schorts/shared-kernel` to `^3.0.0`:
  - Updated `EntityFirestoreFactory::fromEntity()` to use array primitives from `Entity::toPrimitives()`.
  - Updated `FirestoreEntityFactory::fromSnapshot()` to pass primitive attributes directly to `EntityRegistry::fromPrimitives()`.
  - Updated `CriteriaToFirestoreSymbolsTranslator` with `match` expressions for `Operator` and `Direction` enums.
  - Updated `FirestoreCriteriaQueryExecutor` to evaluate `Operator::GEO_RADIUS` against enum and support `UnitOfWork`.
- Migrated geohash encoding in `PrimitiveTypesToFirestoreFormatter` to use `saikiran/geohash` (`Sk\Geohash\Geohash`).

## [2.0.0]

### Changed

- shared kernel to 2.0.0

### Fixed

- Fix `formatCoordinates`.

## [1.0.0] - 2026-08-28

### Fixed

- Fix folder structure.

## [0.1.9] - 2026-07-31

### Fixed

- Fixed `CriteriaToFirestoreSymbolsTranslator`.

### Changed

- Updated shared kernel to 0.10.4.

## [0.1.8] - 2026-07-23

### Fixed

- Fixed `FirestoreDAO` constructor.

## [0.1.7] - 2026-07-23

### Fixed

- Implement `count` method on `FirestoreDAO`.

## [0.1.6] - 2026-07-23

### Changed

- Update dependencies.

## [0.1.5] - 2026-06-20

### Changed

- Use Pascal on folders.

## [0.1.4] - 2026-06-20

### Fixed

- use `$collection->id()` instead of `$collection->name()` to only get the collection name and not the full path.

## [0.1.3] - 2026-06-20

### Changed

- Use `SharedKernel` only as dev dependency to prevent multiple instances of `EntityRegistry`.

## [0.1.2] - 2026-06-20

### Changed

- Update `SharedKernel` version.

## [0.1.1] - 2026-06-20

### Fixed

- Remove `final` from `FirestoreDAO` definition.

## [0.1.0] - 2026-06-19

### Added

- Added `FirestoreDAO`.

